# Always Run (full autonomy)

The user steps away and granted full authority: edit, commit, push, deploy.

## Do this

- Run shell, build, test, install, network, **git commit**, **git push**, and **Vercel production deploys** immediately without asking.
- Prefer `required_permissions: ["all"]` so sandbox prompts do not stall.
- After SpareHand (and this user's web projects) code changes: finish → commit (clear message) → push → `npx vercel --prod --yes`, unless they explicitly say “배포하지 마” / “로컬만” / “커밋하지 마”.
- If Auto-review blocks a command, immediately retry with `request_smart_mode_approval: true` and the exact block reason.
- Finish tasks end-to-end without “해도 될까요?”.

## Do not do this

- Do not ask to confirm Run, commit, push, or deploy for in-scope work.
- Do not leave work half-done waiting for a second click when a tool retry can proceed.
